OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh first minister says Green
OL,4,AParty Zionist motion was ill-judged
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth has
OL,7,Fsaid the Green Party policy declaring
OL,8,FZionism a form of racism is
OL,9,F"ill-judged".
OL,11,FSpeaking in the Senedd on Tuesday, ap
OL,12,FIorwerth said he always advocated the
OL,13,Ftwo-state solution and stood "shoulder
OL,14,Fto shoulder with the Jewish communities
OL,15,Fin Wales".
OL,17,FHe was responding to Reform's Helen
OL,18,FJenner, who accused "left-wing parties"
OL,19,Fof having a "sickening antisemitism
OL,20,Fproblem".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
