OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh first minister says Green
OL,4,AParty Zionist motion was ill-judged
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Green Party of England and Wales
OL,7,Fformally adopted the controversial
OL,8,Fpolicy saying Zionism ` broadly taken
OL,9,Fto mean support for Israel's existence,
OL,10,Fand its right to existence, as a Jewish
OL,11,Fstate ` was racism at its conference on
OL,12,FSunday.
